Z||000000||REDHOTT88||12-11-2001||02:36 PM||||My 88 Formula is totally awesome now!!<P>It has always had great paint and clearcoat, but, I ordered FORMULA decals and sail panels from Paul McKibben, the spare tire cover, Fiero third brake light stencil, and wheel overlays from Rodney D'man, and they really look nice!!!<P>Also have the HOLLEY air intake cover!<P>Combine that with a Mobil 1 oil change, X2 Fram oil filter (twice as big as original) a wash, wax, vacuum (including the engine compartment & wheel wells) and a hearty helping of Armor All throughout, I'm all dressed up and no place to go!!!!<P>Guess I'll go sit in it and GLEEM!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>THEN I'll put my cover back on and wait for Spring!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_zz.gif"><P>Yes, I'm bragging, but the Fiero can look soooo good if you try!<P>  <P>------------------<BR>Steve<BR><B>1988 Formula 2.8L</B> V6 5 speed <BR><FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> (Red and shiny all over!)</FONT><p>[This message has been edited by REDHOTT88 (edited 12-11-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Dumba$$||12-11-2001||02:43 PM||||SWEET!!<BR>ive been thinking about the 3rd brake light thingys  but they always go for so much on e-bay  it kind of bothers me that the font isnt exactly correct  maby im just to picky<P>------------------<BR>Rich<BR>Sioux Falls SD<BR>Red 84 SE<BR>Gold 86 SE <BR>98 acura cl 3.0<P>ever notice that people that own a fiero, either have, or have had other fieros?||||reg||1
