Z||000003||REDHOTT88||12-11-2001||04:49 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dumba$$:<BR><B>SWEET!!<BR>ive been thinking about the 3rd brake light thingys  but they always go for so much on e-bay  it kind of bothers me that the font isnt exactly correct  maby im just to picky<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The 3rd brake cover is $15.00 from Rodney Dickman.com (not too pricey..)  It looks really good, not "RICEY", if you know what I mean... and the "Fiero" lettering is not too far off from the actual logo.<P>As far as e-Bay, I've seen some things you can buy from Rodney, Fiero Store etc., going for twice as much as you could order them!!<P>Example: I just bought a Leather key chain w/ Fiero logo for $4.95 from Fiero Store, it was on e-bay for  7.95 at last bid I saw!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><P>As far as pix go I need to take some. I'm very impressed with everyone else's photos. I just don't know how to post them on here yet!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Steve<BR><B>1988 Formula 2.8L</B> V6 5 speed <BR><FONT COLOR="ffoooo"> (Red and shiny all over!)</FONT><p>[This message has been edited by REDHOTT88 (edited 12-11-2001).]||||reg||1
